00:30:15.790 --> 00:30:23.330
Mark Blackman: Is forecasted to be, towards the end of this year, and so we still are preparing it.

264
00:30:23.490 --> 00:30:26.579
Mark Blackman: But at some point, when it is ready.

265
00:30:26.790 --> 00:30:38.050
Mark Blackman: this library will be critical to the software build of a consensus node. So this will be a dependent library for the consensus node.

266
00:30:38.630 --> 00:30:53.679
Mark Blackman: So because of that, we wanted to migrate this over to the HIRO repo so that this critical dependency is within the same organization as the consensus node.

